  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nCan some rough estimations of what CPU performance is needed for which kind of usage?\r\n\r\nExample of usage\r\n- room with 30 people with E2EE\r\n  - with most people from other instances\r\n- bringing with IRC or Telegram, etc\r\n\r\nExample of low end servers that are attractive to self host thing cheaply:\r\nhttps://www.kimsufi.com/uk/servers.xml\r\nWhich limitations should we expect with CPUs such as these? :\r\n\r\nhttps://ark.intel.com/content/www/us/en/ark/products/49489/intel-atom-processor-d425-512k-cache-1-80-ghz.html\r\nhttps://ark.intel.com/content/www/us/en/ark/products/58917/intel-atom-processor-n2800-1m-cache-1-86-ghz.html",
